Description: experimental encrypted terminal messenger over Tor
 Veil IM creates a terminal-based one-to-one messaging session using Tor v3
 onion services, authenticated application identities, and encrypted frames.
 .
 This package is an unaudited alpha and is not suitable for high-risk use.
